BO3 is an abbreviation of "'''Best of three'''" which is a very common [[QuakeWorld]] match format meaning that the team/player who is able to win 2 maps out of 3 first, is the winner of the match. By using Best of three format leagues for example are able to avoid tied games. 

[[European Quake League]] and [[Nations Quake Rank]] are known for using this match format for their group stage matches.

